    <bpmn:process id="W_W1766" name="W1766. Consumer Credit Application Processing at POS" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer requests installment payment at POS
Frequency: ~15–25 installment transactions per store per day (~3–5% of POS transactions; ≈90,000–150,000/month chain-wide per W747)
Volume: ~3–5% of POS transactions use installment financing (~90,000–150,000/month, per W747&#x27;s ~4,000/day anchor)
Owner: Cashier
Participants: Cashier, Customer, Financing Partner (real-time)
Source: workflow W1766 — Consumer Credit Application Processing at POS</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1766_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1766_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1766_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1766_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1766_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1766_Lane2" name="Sales Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1766_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1766_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1766_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1766_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1766_Start5" name="Customer requests installment payment at POS">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1766_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1766_Task6" name="Customer selects items and requests installment payment at checkout; Cashier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer selects items and requests installment payment at checkout; Cashier confirms eligibility: (a) total transaction amount meets minimum (typically ≥ PHP 3,000–5,000), (b) items are eligible for installment (not clearance, not services), (c) customer presents valid credit card (for bank installment) or applies for non-card financing
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1766_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1766_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1766_Task7" name="For credit card installment: (a) Cashier selects installment payment method in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: For credit card installment: (a) Cashier selects installment payment method in POS, (b) selects term (3/6/12/24/36 months per promo), (c) swipes/taps customer credit card, (d) POS sends installment conversion request to acquiring bank, (e) approval received in real-time (3–10 seconds), (f) receipt printed showing installment details (monthly amount, term, total cost)
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3–5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1766_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1766_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1766_Task8" name="For non-card financing (e.g., Home Credit): (a) customer presents valid ID and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For non-card financing (e.g., Home Credit): (a) customer presents valid ID and provides personal information, (b) Sales Associate assists customer with financing partner application (tablet or kiosk), (c) financing partner performs credit assessment (real-time, 5–15 minutes), (d) approval/rejection communicated to customer, (e) if approved: transaction processed at POS with partner payment method, (f) customer signs financing agreement with partner (not BuildRight)
Responsible (R): Sales Associate / Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 15–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1766_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1766_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1766_Task9" name="Transaction completed: (a) BuildRight receives full transaction amount from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Transaction completed: (a) BuildRight receives full transaction amount from financing partner at settlement (minus MDR), (b) customer&#x27;s payment obligation is with financing partner (not BuildRight), (c) no AR risk for BuildRight on consumer installment transactions
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1766_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1766_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1766_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1766_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1766_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-355 (ensure controlled execution — Consumer Financing Program Management (PA-38.1).) | - operational: Cashier review and approval gate
Owner: Cashier</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1766_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1766_Annotation11" targetRef="W1766_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
