        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-355 (ensure controlled execution — Consumer Financing Program Management (PA-38.1).) | - operational: Department Supervisor review and approval gate
Owner: Department Supervisor</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
